DESCRIPTION >
    Alerts: week-over-week pageview comparison. Tenant-scoped; prunes via
    (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/alerts.js:30
    (queryName 'alert_traffic'). Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6):
    properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type. No JSON-bag fields.
    IDENTICAL query text to integ_traffic.pipe (api/routes/integrations.js:143)
    — duplicate logic across two route files, flagged as a Phase-6
    consolidation candidate (noted, not acted on, per the dispatch).
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE alert_traffic_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        SUM(CASE WHEN timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 7 DAY THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS this_week,
        SUM(CASE WHEN timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 14 DAY AND timestamp < now() - INTERVAL 7 DAY THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS last_week
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$pageview'
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 14 DAY

TYPE endpoint
